'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a cape and a [[player card]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|cosmetic set]], found on page # of the [[Scope of Authority Premium Warbond#Page 1|Scope of Authority Premium Warbond]], can be claimed separately for {{Currency|Medals|8|notext}} and {{Currency|Medals|2}} respectively

